{"page":375,"verses":[{"verse_key":"26:184","surah":26,"ayah":184,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُمْ وَٱلْجِبِلَّةَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Be mindful of God who created you and former generations,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"26:184"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"26:184"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَكُمْ","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"26:184"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْجِبِلَّةَ","en_gloss":"and the generations","transliteration":"wal-jibilata","verse_key":"26:184"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_gloss":"the former","transliteration":"l-awalīna","verse_key":"26:184"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٨٤","en_gloss":"(184)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"26:184"}]},{"verse_key":"26:185","surah":26,"ayah":185,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مِنَ ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but they replied, ‘You are bewitched!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"26:185"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"26:185"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"26:185"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(are) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"26:185"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ","en_gloss":"those bewitched","transliteration":"l-musaḥarīna","verse_key":"26:185"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٨٥","en_gloss":"(185)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"26:185"}]},{"verse_key":"26:186","surah":26,"ayah":186,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَنتَ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُنَا وَإِن نَّظُنُّكَ لَمِنَ ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You are nothing but a man like us. In fact we think you are a liar.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"26:186"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta",