eat","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"26:189"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٨٩","en_gloss":"(189)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"26:189"}]},{"verse_key":"26:190","surah":26,"ayah":190,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَةً ۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There truly is a sign in this, though most of them will not believe:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَـَٔايَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"surely, is a sign","transliteration":"laāyatan","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"are","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَكْثَرُهُم","en_gloss":"most of them","transliteration":"aktharuhum","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"mu'minīna","verse_key":"26:190"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٩٠","en_gloss":"(190)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"26:190"}]},{"verse_key":"26:191","surah":26,"ayah":191,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"your Lord alone is the Almighty, the Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"26:191"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"26:191"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُوَ","en_gloss":"surely, He","transliteration":"lahuwa","verse_key":"26:191"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"26:191"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"26:191"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٩١","en_gloss":"(191)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"26:191